* ClassA2 device models
*
* NOT MANUFACTURER MODELS. Every model below except BC546B/BC556B is an
* author-created Gummel-Poon approximation fitted by hand to a few typical
* values read from the manufacturer datasheet named in its comment (hFE at the
* datasheet test current, VBE-IC curve, Cob, fT). They are good enough for
* operating points, loop-gain shape and gross distortion trends. They are not
* good enough to claim absolute THD, exact phase margin, or thermal behaviour.
* XTB/XTI/EG give the normal Vbe tempco (about -2 mV/K); there is no
* self-heating. Junction temperatures are set per device with temp=.
*
* --- Output pair (Toshiba datasheets 2013-11-01) ---------------------------
* 2SC5198: hFE(1) 55-160 at 5 V/1 A (typ ~100 from curve), hFE(2) typ 83 at 5 A,
* VBE typ 0.9 V at 5 A, ~0.72 V at 1 A (curve), fT 30 MHz typ at 1 A,
* Cob 170 pF at VCB = 10 V.
.model Q2SC5198 NPN(IS=1.5e-11 BF=105 NF=1 VAF=120 IKF=8 ISE=2e-10 NE=1.8 BR=6 NR=1
+ VAR=20 IKR=2 RB=2.5 IRB=0.1 RBM=0.5 RE=0.03 RC=0.08 CJE=1.5n VJE=0.75 MJE=0.4
+ CJC=500p VJC=0.7 MJC=0.4 XCJC=0.5 TF=4.5n XTF=10 VTF=10 ITF=4 TR=500n
+ XTB=1.4 EG=1.11 XTI=3)
* 2SA1941: hFE(1) 55-160 at -5 V/-1 A (typ ~105), VBE ~0.75 V at 1 A (curve),
* fT 30 MHz typ, Cob 320 pF at VCB = -10 V.
.model Q2SA1941 PNP(IS=7e-12 BF=110 NF=1 VAF=100 IKF=7 ISE=2e-10 NE=1.8 BR=6 NR=1
+ VAR=20 IKR=2 RB=3 IRB=0.1 RBM=0.6 RE=0.03 RC=0.08 CJE=1.8n VJE=0.75 MJE=0.4
+ CJC=950p VJC=0.7 MJC=0.4 XCJC=0.5 TF=5.5n XTF=10 VTF=10 ITF=4 TR=500n
+ XTB=1.4 EG=1.11 XTI=3)
*
* --- Drivers / bias sensor (onsemi BD139/D rev 3, ST BD135 family) ---------
* hFE3 40-250 at 2 V/150 mA; VBE(on) <1 V at 0.5 A; fT not specified by
* onsemi, ~100 MHz assumed (conservative).
.model QBD139 NPN(IS=1.5e-13 BF=150 NF=1 VAF=100 IKF=0.6 ISE=2e-13 NE=1.6 BR=5
+ RB=5 RE=0.15 RC=0.3 CJE=120p VJE=0.7 MJE=0.35 CJC=40p VJC=0.6 MJC=0.4
+ TF=1.5n TR=100n XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3)
.model QBD140 PNP(IS=1.5e-13 BF=150 NF=1 VAF=100 IKF=0.6 ISE=2e-13 NE=1.6 BR=5
+ RB=5 RE=0.15 RC=0.3 CJE=130p VJE=0.7 MJE=0.35 CJC=60p VJC=0.6 MJC=0.4
+ TF=2n TR=100n XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3)
*
* --- VAS (Toshiba 2SC2705/2SA1145, TO-92MOD 2-5J1A) -------------------------
* VCEO 150 V, IC 50 mA, PC 0.8 W, hFE 80-240 at 5 V/10 mA, fT 200 MHz,
* Cob 1.8 pF (2SC2705) / 2.5 pF (2SA1145).
.model Q2SC2705 NPN(IS=1.7e-14 BF=160 NF=1 VAF=200 IKF=0.1 ISE=1e-14 NE=1.5 BR=5
+ RB=20 RE=0.5 RC=5 CJE=10p VJE=0.7 MJE=0.35 CJC=4.4p VJC=0.6 MJC=0.33
+ TF=0.6n TR=50n XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3)
.model Q2SA1145 PNP(IS=2e-14 BF=160 NF=1 VAF=150 IKF=0.1 ISE=1e-14 NE=1.5 BR=5
+ RB=20 RE=0.5 RC=5 CJE=12p VJE=0.7 MJE=0.35 CJC=6p VJC=0.6 MJC=0.33
+ TF=0.8n TR=50n XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3)
*
* --- Input pairs (Toshiba 2SC2240 2007-11-01, 2SA970 2003-03-24) ------------
* VCEO 120 V, IC 100 mA, PC 300 mW, Tj 125 C. VBE 0.65 V typ at 2 mA.
* fT 100 MHz at 1 mA. Cob 3.0 pF (2SC2240) / 4.0 pF (2SA970).
* GR rank 200-400 (BF 300 here), BL rank 350-700 (BF 500 here).
.model Q2SC2240GR NPN(IS=2.4e-14 BF=300 NF=1 VAF=100 IKF=0.08 ISE=5e-15 NE=1.5
+ BR=5 RB=30 RE=0.5 RC=2 CJE=12p VJE=0.7 MJE=0.35 CJC=7p VJC=0.6 MJC=0.35
+ TF=1.0n TR=50n XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3 KF=1e-16 AF=1)
.model Q2SA970BL PNP(IS=3e-14 BF=500 NF=1 VAF=80 IKF=0.06 ISE=5e-15 NE=1.5
+ BR=5 RB=20 RE=0.5 RC=2 CJE=14p VJE=0.7 MJE=0.35 CJC=9p VJC=0.6 MJC=0.35
+ TF=1.2n TR=50n XTB=1.5 EG=1.11 XTI=3 KF=1e-16 AF=1)
*
* --- Current sources: BC546B/BC556B (Philips-style models, also used by
* MOSFETAmp2/simulation/models/devices.lib; XTB=0 so no hFE tempco).
.model BC546B NPN(IS=2.39E-14 NF=1.008 ISE=3.55E-15 NE=1.541 BF=294.3 IKF=0.1357
+ VAF=63.2 NR=1.004 ISC=6.27E-14 NC=1.243 BR=7.946 IKR=0.1144 VAR=25.9 RB=1
+ IRB=1.00E-06 RBM=1 RE=0.4683 RC=0.85 XTB=0 EG=1.11 XTI=3 CJE=1.36E-11 VJE=0.65
+ MJE=0.3279 TF=4.39E-10 XTF=120 VTF=2.643 ITF=0.7495 PTF=0 CJC=3.73E-12
+ VJC=0.3997 MJC=0.2955 XCJC=0.6193 TR=1.00E-32 CJS=0 VJS=0.75 MJS=0.333 FC=0.9579)
.model BC556B PNP(IS=3.83E-14 NF=1.008 ISE=1.22E-14 NE=1.528 BF=344.4 IKF=0.08039
+ VAF=21.11 NR=1.005 ISC=2.85E-13 NC=1.28 BR=14.84 IKR=0.047 VAR=32.02 RB=1
+ IRB=1.00E-06 RBM=1 RE=0.6202 RC=0.5713 XTB=0 EG=1.11 XTI=3 CJE=1.23E-11
+ VJE=0.6106 MJE=0.378 TF=5.60E-10 XTF=3.414 VTF=5.23 ITF=0.1483 PTF=0
+ CJC=1.08E-11 VJC=0.1022 MJC=0.3563 XCJC=0.6288 TR=1.00E-32 CJS=0 VJS=0.75
+ MJS=0.333 FC=0.8027)
*
* 1N4148 (author approximation, as MOSFETAmp2 D4148)
.model D4148 D(IS=2.5n RS=0.6 N=1.75 CJO=4p TT=4n BV=100)
* Bridge rectifier diode for the PSU study (generic 3 A silicon, e.g. 1N5408).
.model DRECT D(IS=5n RS=0.02 N=1.6 CJO=50p TT=3u BV=1000)
